---
source: crates/deft-cli/../../tests/unit/help.rs
expression: "help::group(g.name)"
---
deft audio - commands (input -> output)
  info            audio -> report    Duration, codec, sample rate, channels
  chunk           audio -> audio...  Cut into equal parts: --length 10:00
  compress        audio -> mp3       Re-encode as MP3 at --bitrate (kbps)
  convert         audio -> audio     Change format: --to mp3|m4a|wav|flac|ogg|opus
  denoise         audio -> audio     Reduce steady background noise such as hiss or hum
  fade            audio -> audio     Fade in or out: --fade-in 2 --fade-out 3
  from-video      video -> audio     Save the soundtrack: --to mp3|m4a|wav|flac|ogg
  merge           audio... -> mp3    Join audio files in order
  mix             audio... -> audio  Play files on top of each other, such as voice over music
  normalize       audio -> audio     Even out loudness (EBU R128)
  remove-silence  audio -> audio     Cut silent parts: --threshold -40 --min-silence 0.5
  reverse         audio -> audio     Play backwards
  speed           audio -> audio     Change tempo, keeping pitch: --factor 1.5
  split           audio -> audio     Cut out a part: --from 0:10 --to-time 0:25
  strip           audio -> audio     Remove tags and cover art; no re-encode
  tag             audio -> audio     Set tags: --title --artist --album --year, cover --image
  volume          audio -> audio     Raise or lower the level: --gain 6 or --gain -3 (dB)
More: deft audio <command> --help
